      "text_helper": "Section 12.3.1 \"DAC channel enable\" in chapter 12 (Digital-to-analog converter (DAC)), RM0008 Rev 21, page 256.",
      "section_content": "Each DAC channel can be powered on by setting its corresponding ENx bit in the DAC_CR\nregister. The DAC channel is then enabled after a startup time tWAKEUP.\nNote: The ENx bit enables the analog DAC Channelx macrocell only. The DAC Channelx digital\ninterface is enabled even if the ENx bit is reset.",
